  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Prince Feng Xian receives Fairy Li Shan and Qin Bai Sheng in Feng Xian grotto-heaven, he orders You Lan to see the guests out. She is the cool, aloof one of the two female Gu Immortals standing beside him. She leads the guests out in silence and closes the grotto-heaven entrance when asked to stop escorting them.",
      "chapters": [
        743
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_prince_feng_xian",
        "char_fairy_li_shan",
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "loc_feng_xian_grotto_heaven",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is also known as Fairy You Lan.",
      "chapters": [
        749
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She is cool and refined like ice and snow, and cool and aloof beside the other female attendant.",
      "chapters": [
        743
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She has a cold attitude.",
      "chapters": [
        744
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Feng Jiu Ge enters the auction hall transformed into her, the copy is a cold-looking female Gu Immortal who walks in silently.",
      "chapters": [
        749
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Prince Feng Xian does not hide from his attendants that Feng Jiu Ge will take his place at the auction. Feng Jiu Ge then transforms into an exact copy of Swordmaster You Lan, including sword path dao marks and a Northern Plains aura, choosing her because she barely speaks and the disguise needs little acting. She stares with wide eyes when the transformation appears.",
      "chapters": [
        744
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "auction-disguise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the auction hall the disguised figure walks in as Fairy You Lan representing Prince Feng Xian.",
      "chapters": [
        749
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "auction-disguise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prince Feng Xian still has Swordmaster You Lan and Le Yao under him among other secret forces when he cannot act openly.",
      "chapters": [
        953
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "attendant-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_le_yao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He later stays in Feng Xian grotto-heaven with those two female attendant Gu Immortals, You Lan and Le Yao.",
      "chapters": [
        1110
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "attendant-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Immortal You Lan speaks beside him against letting Old Ancestor Xue Hu finish refining a rank eight Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1144
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "attendant-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_ancestor_xue_hu",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le Yao and Swordmaster You Lan are Gu Immortals from Spirit Affinity House; she stays at the base while Le Yao accompanies Prince Feng Xian near Loose Tail Ridge.",
      "chapters": [
        1546
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spirit-affinity-house-origin",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house",
        "loc_loose_tail_ridge"
      ]
    }
  ],
